{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b60fe9d64034bcd7","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9007-BRANCH-A-E002\n3\ttitle: Midstream onboarding of the Milvus repository\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9007\n5\tcomponent: Platform Operator\n6\tteam: RHOAI Platform\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\timplementation_type: repo-onboarding\n10\tbranch: A\n11\tgated_by: RHAISTRAT-9007-E001\n12\tdependencies:\n13\t- RHAISTRAT-9007-E001\n14\tgate_failure_impact:\n15\t  action: remove\n16\t  fallback_approach: If the external-connection-only posture is chosen first, this\n17\t    epic is removed; no Milvus repository is onboarded and the external-path branch\n18\t    covers the outcome.\n19\tai_signals:\n20\t  change_specificity: 1\n21\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n22\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n23\t  existing_foundation: 1\n24\t  open_questions: 1\n25\t  external_dependency: 0\n26\t  human_process_gates: -1\n27\t  repo_access: 1\n28\t  architecture_claims: 0\n29\tinvestigation_signals: null\n30\tai_implementability: High\n31\tai_implementability_score: 4\n32\tjira_key: null\n33\t---\n34\t# Midstream onboarding of the Milvus repository\n35\t\n36\t## Description\n37\t\n38\tCreates the midstream home for the Milvus vector database source under\n39\topendatahub-io so the platform can build productized Milvus container images.\n40\tThis is the repository onboarding step of bringing a new upstream component\n41\tinto the platform for the managed vector store posture; the build pipeline and\n42\toperator deployment capabilities build on it. Applies only if the\n43\tplatform-managed posture is selected.\n44\t\n45\t## Scope\n46\t\n47\t- Fork or import the identified upstream Milvus release into a midstream\n48\t  repository under the opendatahub-io organization.\n49\t- Establish the branching and rebasing workflow used by other midstream\n50\t  repositories, including documenting how upstream releases are tracked.\n51\t- Verify the source builds from a clean checkout at the pinned upstream\n52\t  version, and record build instructions.\n53\t- Register the repository with the platform's midstream conventions (owners,\n54\t  branch protection, CI triggers where applicable).\n55\t\n56\t## Acceptance Criteria\n57\t\n58\t- A midstream Milvus repository exists under opendatahub-io, seeded from a\n59\t  pinned upstream release that is recorded in the repository.\n60\t- The documented branching/rebasing workflow is written down and a first rebase\n61\t  or sync from upstream has been exercised successfully.\n62\t- The repository builds from a clean checkout following only its documented\n63\t  instructions.\n64\t- Repository conventions (ownership, branch protection) are configured.\n65\t\n66\t## HLR Traceability\n67\t\n68\t- HLR-2 (P0, managed path): enables \"productized images\" for the\n69\t  operator-deployed managed vector store.\n70\t\n71\t## Notes\n72\t\n73\t- Milvus is a new component for the platform — it has no architecture-context\n74\t  file and is not a canonical RHAI Jira component; this work is filed under the\n75\t  Platform Operator component as the deploying and lifecycle-owning surface.\n76\t- This epic runs in parallel with license validation of Milvus and its\n77\t  transitive dependencies; neither blocks the other.\n78\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-87f4e20588d33d19","agent_id":"a7ddffbabf94dcc2a","session_id":"8e36c23f-2012-48a8-9407-9b1658e84980","uuid":"8a9bc074-390c-4cc1-831d-4fd503c49a40","timestamp":"2026-10-22T16:31:00.752Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b60fe9d64034bcd7","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9007 decomposition"}
