{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9dc427841ec291f4","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9007-BRANCH-A-E004\n3\ttitle: Konflux build pipeline onboarding for productized Milvus images\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9007\n5\tcomponent: Platform Operator\n6\tteam: RHOAI Platform\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\timplementation_type: konflux-onboarding\n10\tbranch: A\n11\tgated_by: RHAISTRAT-9007-E001\n12\tdependencies:\n13\t- RHAISTRAT-9007-E001\n14\t- RHAISTRAT-9007-BRANCH-A-E002\n15\tgate_failure_impact:\n16\t  action: remove\n17\t  fallback_approach: If the external-connection-only posture is chosen first, this\n18\t    epic is removed; no productized Milvus images are built because the managed store\n19\t    is not shipped.\n20\tai_signals:\n21\t  change_specificity: 1\n22\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n23\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n24\t  existing_foundation: 1\n25\t  open_questions: 1\n26\t  external_dependency: 0\n27\t  human_process_gates: -1\n28\t  repo_access: 1\n29\t  architecture_claims: 0\n30\tinvestigation_signals: null\n31\tai_implementability: High\n32\tai_implementability_score: 4\n33\tjira_key: null\n34\t---\n35\t# Konflux build pipeline onboarding for productized Milvus images\n36\t\n37\t## Description\n38\t\n39\tOnboards the midstream Milvus repository to Konflux so the platform produces\n40\tbuildable, released container images for the managed vector store. This\n41\tdelivers the build pipeline for productized Milvus images; it does not block\n42\tthe operator deployment work, which proceeds in parallel and is gated instead\n43\tby acceptance criteria on image availability. Applies only if the\n44\tplatform-managed posture is selected.\n45\t\n46\t## Scope\n47\t\n48\t- Create the Konflux onboarding configuration for the midstream Milvus\n49\t  repository, following the standard known-recipe used for other platform\n50\t  components.\n51\t- Wire image builds for the pinned Milvus version into the pipeline, including\n52\t  the image build and push configuration used for platform releases.\n53\t- Verify the pipeline runs end to end on the repository's default branch and\n54\t  produces publishable image artifacts.\n55\t\n56\t## Acceptance Criteria\n57\t\n58\t- Konflux onboarding configuration for the midstream Milvus repository is\n59\t  merged and active.\n60\t- The build pipeline produces Milvus container images from the midstream\n61\t  repository without manual intervention beyond the documented triggers.\n62\t- A full pipeline run on the default branch completes green, and the resulting\n63\t  images are pushed to the registry the platform uses for released images.\n64\t\n65\t## HLR Traceability\n66\t\n67\t- HLR-2 (P0, managed path): \"productized images\" for the operator-deployed\n68\t  managed vector store.\n69\t\n70\t## Notes\n71\t\n72\t- This epic depends on the midstream Milvus repository existing (the pipeline\n73\t  needs a repository to build from).\n74\t- The operator deployment work runs in parallel with this epic; its\n75\t  first-execution gate is the availability of a green build pipeline and pinned\n76\t  image digests, captured as acceptance criteria there rather than as a\n77\t  scheduling dependency.\n78\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-87f4e20588d33d19","agent_id":"a7ddffbabf94dcc2a","session_id":"8e36c23f-2012-48a8-9407-9b1658e84980","uuid":"6ebdc1b9-1197-45bf-a730-28305edaf19c","timestamp":"2026-10-22T16:31:03.051Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9dc427841ec291f4","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9007 decomposition"}
