{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a9e0acd0af376724","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9007-BRANCH-A-E005\n3\ttitle: Managed vector store deployment via the Platform Operator\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9007\n5\tcomponent: Platform Operator\n6\tteam: RHOAI Platform\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\tbranch: A\n10\tgated_by: RHAISTRAT-9007-E001\n11\tdependencies:\n12\t- RHAISTRAT-9007-E001\n13\t- RHAISTRAT-9007-BRANCH-A-E003\n14\tgate_failure_impact:\n15\t  action: remove\n16\t  fallback_approach: If the external-connection-only posture is chosen first, this\n17\t    epic is removed; administrators get no managed vector store and the external-path\n18\t    branch covers the outcome.\n19\tai_signals:\n20\t  change_specificity: 0\n21\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n22\t  adapter_pattern: 1\n23\t  existing_foundation: 1\n24\t  open_questions: 1\n25\t  external_dependency: 0\n26\t  human_process_gates: 0\n27\t  repo_access: 1\n28\t  architecture_claims: 0\n29\timplementation_type: null\n30\tinvestigation_signals: null\n31\tai_implementability: High\n32\tai_implementability_score: 5\n33\tjira_key: null\n34\t---\n35\t# Managed vector store deployment via the Platform Operator\n36\t\n37\t## Description\n38\t\n39\tExtends the Platform Operator so administrators can deploy and lifecycle the\n40\tplatform-managed Milvus vector store with productized images, delivering the\n41\tmanaged half of HLR-2: regulated customers get a platform-managed vector\n42\tdatabase with supported images and lifecycle. Applies only if the\n43\tplatform-managed posture is selected.\n44\t\n45\t## Scope\n46\t\n47\t- Add the managed vector store as a deployable, lifecycle-managed operand of\n48\t  the Platform Operator: deployment, readiness, and reconciliation to desired\n49\t  state.\n50\t- Reference the productized Milvus images by pinned digest from the platform's\n51\t  released-image registry.\n52\t- Provide the administrator-facing deployment controls at the functional level\n53\t  the strategy states: an administrator can deploy the managed vector store\n54\t  through the Platform Operator.\n55\t- Ensure deletion and re-creation of the managed vector store works cleanly\n56\t  (lifecycle coverage per the strategy's \"supported images and lifecycle\"\n57\t  language).\n58\t\n59\t## Acceptance Criteria\n60\t\n61\t- An administrator can deploy the managed vector store through the Platform\n62\t  Operator, and the store reaches a ready/usable state without manual pod\n63\t  surgery.\n64\t- The deployment uses the productized Milvus images by pinned digest from the\n65\t  platform image registry, and the digest is available at deployment time (the\n66\t  build pipeline for the productized images is green on the midstream\n67\t  repository).\n68\t- The operator reconciles the managed vector store to desired state: deleting\n69\t  and re-creating the store, and recovering from induced failure of its\n70\t  components, converges back to ready.\n71\t- The deployment works with the platform's standard configuration surfaces (no\n72\t  hand-edited manifests required beyond documented administrator input).\n73\t\n74\t## HLR Traceability\n75\t\n76\t- HLR-2 (P0, managed path): \"administrators can deploy the managed vector\n77\t  store through the Platform Operator with productized images.\"\n78\t\n79\t## Notes\n80\t\n81\t- This epic must not start before Milvus license validation completes: a\n82\t  license failure changes the dependency set and the approach.\n83\t- This epic runs in parallel with the Konflux onboarding of the Milvus build\n84\t  pipeline; the coupling is enforced by the pinned-digest and green-pipeline\n85\t  acceptance criteria above, not by a scheduling dependency.\n86\t- The Platform Operator has no architecture-context file; the implementing team\n87\t  should confirm existing operand-deployment patterns before designing the\n88\t  integration.\n89\t- The Llama Stack provider wiring and the Dashboard deploy-and-manage UI build\n90\t  on the operand/connection surface this epic defines.\n91\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-87f4e20588d33d19","agent_id":"a7ddffbabf94dcc2a","session_id":"8e36c23f-2012-48a8-9407-9b1658e84980","uuid":"c11d17a5-a356-4c66-bcfa-994cee79c8fc","timestamp":"2026-10-22T16:31:04.242Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a9e0acd0af376724","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9007 decomposition"}
