gement interactions (deploy the managed store,\n52\t  view its status, delete it) against the CRs the Platform Operator defines for\n53\t  the managed vector store.\n54\t- Gate the integration behind the Dashboard's standard per-component feature\n55\t  flag mechanism (OdhDashboardConfig).\n56\t\n57\t## Acceptance Criteria\n58\t\n59\t- The Dashboard exposes a deploy-and-manage UI for the managed vector store:\n60\t  an administrator can deploy the store, see its status, and delete it from\n61\t  the Dashboard without using raw YAML or the OpenShift console.\n62\t- The UI operates on the CR surface defined by the Platform Operator's managed\n63\t  vector store deployment capability.\n64\t- The integration is feature-flagged via the Dashboard's standard config CR\n65\t  and is off by default where the platform requires it.\n66\t\n67\t## HLR Traceability\n68\t\n69\t- HLR-4 (P1): \"The Dashboard exposes the chosen integration\n70\t  (deploy-and-manage UI for the managed path).\" — managed-path coverage.\n71\t\n72\t## Notes\n73\t\n74\t- Depends on the CR surface the Platform Operator's managed deployment\n75\t  defines; that surface must exist before the UI can be built against it.\n76\t- Runs in parallel with the Llama Stack provider wiring (different\n77\t  repositories, no shared artifacts).\n78\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-87f4e20588d33d19","agent_id":"a7ddffbabf94dcc2a","session_id":"8e36c23f-2012-48a8-9407-9b1658e84980","uuid":"ae7e57ed-e851-49ae-849e-ffeb800e1331","timestamp":"2026-10-22T16:31:12.087Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-bb9370729b6b2c7f","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9007 decomposition"}
